# Goal of the frontend design

- Design a comprehensive AI UI based on the existing UIs in `/Users/avarilewang/Documents/codeRepo/cybernetics/cybernetics-agentics/client/src/components/SystemCore`
  1. UI layer requirements:
     1. - The 3D System Core UI should be the main interface after user login, all other features will be presented in Pop-up windows on top of the 3D System Core UI.
     2. - There will be a Pop-up window for users to login and register.
     3. - There will be a general Pop-up window as a base framework for other features like settings, notifications, user profile management and other features[including contacts, files, ].
     4. - There will be a general terminal window(use all of the existing ai-elements components) for users to input commands and receive outputs from the AI system, this terminal window will be in a dedicated Pop-up window, this is the main interface for users to interact with the AI system.
     5. - There will be a live conversation feature, that allows users to have a real-time conversation with the AI system, this feature should be able to be toggled on and off, there should be a voice icon on the bottom right corner of the 3D System Core UI, when clicked, it will open a Pop-up window for live conversation. close the voice icon wont close the live conversation window, the user can close the live conversation window by clicking the close button on the top right corner of the Pop-up window.
     6. - The UI should have a responsive design to accommodate different screen sizes and devices.
     7. state management should be designed to handle the different states of the UI, such as loading, error, success states, auth, conversation, and other states that may arise during user interaction with the AI system.
